{{define "content"}}
<section class="initialization-page">
<h1>选择本机角色</h1>
{{if .InitializationError}}<div class="operation-refusal"><p>{{.InitializationError}}</p></div>{{end}}
<div class="initialization-choices">
<form method="post" action="/ui/init/role">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<input type="hidden" name="role" value="standalone">
<h2>单机</h2>
<p>一台机器自持 vault，适合只在当前电脑上使用 sshmgr。</p>
<button type="submit">选择单机</button>
</form>
<form method="post" action="/ui/init/role">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<input type="hidden" name="role" value="server">
<h2>权威端</h2>
<p>多机部署里常驻权威 vault，其余机器经配对入网。</p>
<button type="submit">选择权威端</button>
</form>
<form method="post" action="/ui/init/role">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<input type="hidden" name="role" value="client">
<h2>客户端</h2>
<p>只持本地只读快照，修改数据到权威端 Web UI 做。</p>
<button type="submit">选择客户端</button>
</form>
</div>
<p class="initialization-note">权威端的后续步骤尚未实现，本页先保留入口。</p>
</section>
{{end}}
